：该服务处理了1250个请求，在2.5秒内完成，但是有17个请求失败了。\n\n But let me make sure: in Chinese, we don't usually write \"秒\" as a word? It's acceptable.\n\n Alternatively, we can say:\n\n 服务：处理了1250个请求，在2.5秒内，但有17个请求失败。\n\n However, the original uses \"in 2.5 seconds\", so we keep that phrase.\n\n Final decision: \n\n 翻译：该服务处理了1250个请求，在2.5秒内完成，但是有17个请求失败了。\n\n But note: the original says \"but 17 requests failed\", which is a bit abrupt in English, but in Chinese we can use \"但是\" for that.\n\n So I think this translation is acceptable.\n</think>\n\n该服务处理了1250个请求，在2.5秒内完成，但是有17个请求失败了。",
